[gd_resource type="Resource" script_class="CasChapterSceneVisual" load_steps=48 format=3]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_scene_resource.gd" id="1_scene"]

[ext_resource type="Script" path="res://scripts/chapter_line_resource.gd" id="2_line"]

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_0"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="灯塔的检修梯上只有一截干地方。你们把湿纸条铺在那儿，用工具袋压住四角。雨从上面的裂缝滴下来，每次落点都差一点，帕金斯只好不断挪袋子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_1"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="交接暗记不能单独当凭证。现在谁都看过这张纸，后面再见到一样的，可能只是有人照着画。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_2"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="以前是画歪一颗星，后来大家都知道要画歪，反而画得比正常的还整齐。光看样子，查不出是谁的手。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_3"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="你看见纸背有三道压痕，间距不太一样。潮痕把自己的指节放在旁边量了量，又收回去。她说这是从旧登记册上撕下来的，不是随手捡的纸。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_4"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="你认得哪一本？如果能找到前后那两页，应该比暗记更容易核对。撕口总不能每张都一样。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_5"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="认得封面。蓝色，右下角缺了一块。可这儿换过很多批人，我不能因为自己记得，就说它一定还在原来的抽屉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_6"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻让拉姆森查桌下，你和潮痕查柜子，帕金斯留在原地记录。她把任务分完，又提醒大家，打不开的柜门先报出来，不要顺手砸掉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "tideborn"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_7"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="我们还得让后来的人知道，哪些地方是原来坏的，哪些是咱们弄坏的。工具借出去的时候也是这么记，不会因为换成调查就省掉。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_8"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="那我先报一个。第二层抽屉原来就掉底了，里面的东西全落到下面。我只是轻轻拉了一下，这次真的是轻轻的。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "fletcher"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_9"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你上次也这么说。我记下“轻轻的”，等回去跟缺掉的那块一起称。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_10"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="柜子里没有登记册，只有几张叠得很方正的纸袋。最下面的袋子背后写着领用数量，前面却盖了三次不同的章。你拿起来，发现其中一枚章倒着。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_11"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="这个章和第一章那批补给箱上的很像。但如果我说“同一个人送的”，就跨得太远了，对吗？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_12"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="对。最多能说用过同一类印章。章能借、能丢、能补刻，人也会盖反。先把你真的看见的部分留下。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "lamson", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_13"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="倒过来的不是失误。这枚章的柄坏了，握着正面会割手，值班的人才一直反着盖。修好以后，印出来还是倒的，因为大家习惯了。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_14"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕说完，自己先停了一下。她拿过一张废纸，在旁边写“个人记忆，待核实”。你发现她写得很慢，像第一次认真对付这个不怎么好看的词。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_15"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="这里有柄。没找到登记册，找到一盒修不好的东西。你看这个缺口，是不是你说会割手的地方？"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_16"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="盒子里躺着一截木柄，断口已经被磨圆。帕金斯没有立刻把它和纸袋放在一起，而是先在原处拍完。你负责记下盒子从哪层柜里拿出来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_17"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="印章能说明纸袋来过这里。纸袋背面的数字，能不能和电池领用凭条对上？如果都少了两块，我们就有另一条线。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_18"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="这才是要查的。别一上来就问谁是坏人。先问东西在哪儿少了，谁说自己收到了，谁又真的用过。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_19"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="数字并没有整齐地对上。纸袋记着六，凭条记着五，柜子里只剩四只空盒。拉姆森重新数了一遍，恼火地问是不是还有人把盒子拿去装了螺丝。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "drayton"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_20"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="如果有，我不骂。至少现在不骂。谁再查一遍工具抽屉？最容易弄错的时候，就是大家都觉得这个数应该一样。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_21"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="最后一只空盒在墙边当垫脚，里面还压着一张折过的交接单。原来少掉的一块不是偷走，而是被登记成另一种规格，领用人特地在后面补了说明。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_22"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="那就把这个错误也留下。要是只把改正后的数抄回去，别人看到两边不一样，又得从头怀疑一次。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_23"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="还有一块没有说明。我们不替它找解释，先带着这个缺口回去。登记不全，也是一件可以明说的事。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_24"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕把纸袋翻到背面，露出一行小字。那不是暗记，是送货人嫌等得太久，写下“门口风大，下次让我进去”。德雷顿看完，笑得差点碰歪手电。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_25"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="我记得这句。以前以为他是故意挑刺。现在站在这儿才发现，门口确实一直漏风，里面的人听不见。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_26"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="可以查是谁送的，但先别去问他认不认得我们想找的人。拿这句话问，他也许还记得那天为什么生气。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_27"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="帕金斯在清单上新开了一栏，把原件、记忆和推断分别编号。纸条依旧只是一张纸，你却不再盼它自己说出一个完整答案。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_28"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="收好，下一处要过水。纸袋别套在一起，进一次水就会全湿。谁还有没记完的，现在说，我们等这一会儿。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_29"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="潮痕举起手，指了指那行漏风的抱怨。她让你在个人记忆那栏添上“可能认得送货人的声音”。你写完抬头，她仍站在那里，等你把“可能”两个字划得清楚一些。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_30"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="收拾柜子时，拉姆森从最底下掏出一本薄册，封面印着已经褪掉一半的广告。你以为终于找到了登记册，她翻开第一页，却忍不住笑起来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_31"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="欠账本。谁拿走两块糖，谁借了半瓶胶，还有谁答应修窗，一直拖到别人自己修好了。难怪藏得这么深。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_32"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="不是藏，是怕值班长看见。那时不准私下换领来的东西。可有人领到的手套太大，有人领到的鞋太小，总不能真穿着干活。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["fletcher", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_33"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="perkins"

speaker_name=""

text="这本也登记进来。别笑，这种小账常常比整齐的领用表更接近东西最后到了谁手里。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_34"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="账上有一笔反复被圈起：一小包糖，换一次去外层甲板的值班。你猜是有人不愿淋雨，潮痕却摇头，说那个人想在那里听见一段远处的音乐。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_35"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="公共频道每天只放几分钟。他那副耳机接不清，外层天线旁边好一点。后来有人会帮他记住换班，不用每次都拿糖来。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_36"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name="你"

text="还记得是什么音乐吗？不用替我想起什么。我只是觉得，为了几分钟专门调班，应该是首挺喜欢的歌。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_37"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="tideborn"

speaker_name=""

text="我没认真听过。他放的时候我总嫌吵，叫他小点声。我只记得一开头有人数拍子，数得还不齐，每次都有人提前进。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_38"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="她试着打了两下拍子，第三下却没接上。德雷顿敲了敲工具盒，故意比她早一点。两个人重来几次，始终没能数到一起，拉姆森便问她们需不需要指挥。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["perkins", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_39"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="drayton"

speaker_name=""

text="你先管自己的手。你刚才把同一个螺丝捡了两遍，现在又一副能带全队唱歌的样子。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_40"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="lamson"

speaker_name=""

text="唱歌又不用螺丝。等会儿真要临时修广播，倒是你们得来求我，不能一边求，一边笑。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_41"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker=""

speaker_name=""

text="弗莱彻没有催她们停。等你把账本装好，她才问潮痕，那个喜欢听歌的人有没有留下能联系的地方。潮痕说不知道，旧账里没有写这一栏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

text_effect="none"

characters_per_second=34.0

caption=""

actors=Array[String](["drayton", "tideborn", "lamson"])

actor_tones={}

[sub_resource type="Resource" id="Line_42"]

script=ExtResource("2_line")

speaker="fletcher"

speaker_name=""

text="那就先留一条找人的线。不是每条都和教团有关，也不必每条最后都找得到。回去以后，可以问问港口有没有人认得那段前奏。"

tone="calm"

shot="wide"

motion="none"

